    fix(e2e): isolate token-gate test from inherited extraHTTPHeaders
    
    playwright.request.newContext() created via the test fixture inherits
    use.extraHTTPHeaders, so the 'bare' context sent the bearer token and the
    401 assertion could never fail — the gate was never exercised. Clearing
    extraHTTPHeaders makes the test genuinely unauthenticated.

